# Line-ending normalization must not touch anything whose sha256 is pinned.
#
# `docs/P0_BASELINE.md` and `runs/spider_benchmark/*/baseline_manifest.json`
# record content hashes of the vendored evaluator and the run artifacts. If git
# rewrote LF to CRLF on checkout, a fresh clone on Windows would compute
# different hashes and `scripts/freeze_p0_baseline.py --verify` would report
# drift that does not exist.

# Vendored Spider evaluator: byte-identical to the published source, by design.
backend/app/spider/official_eval/*.py -text

# Benchmark artifacts: hashed in the baseline manifest.
runs/spider_benchmark/**/*.jsonl -text
runs/spider_benchmark/**/*.json -text
runs/spider_verifier_qa/*.json -text

# Compressed artifacts are binary.
*.gz binary
